ments `ss`.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/ExcessArgsFrame.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo.new","kind":"def","line":27,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo.new","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/ExcessArgsFrame.lean#L27-L36"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/ExcessArgsFrame.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo.frames\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">ExcessArgsFrameInfo</span>.<span class=\"name\">frames</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/ExcessArgsFrame.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo\">ExcessArgsFrameInfo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/ExcessArgsFrame.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo.frames","kind":"def","line":25,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo.frames","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/ExcessArgsFrame.lean#L25-L25"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/ExcessArgsFrame.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">ExcessArgsFrameInfo</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Lean.Expr</a></span> → <a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/ExcessArgsFrame.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo\">Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/ExcessArgsFrame.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo.mk","kind":"ctor","line":17,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo.mk","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/ExcessArgsFrame.lean#L17-L25"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/ExcessArgsFrame.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">VCGen</span>.<span class=\"name\">ExcessArgsFrameInfo</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The frames of a precondition `pre` for the excess state arguments `s₁ … sₙ` of a goal\n`pre ⊑ X s₁ … sₙ`. For `n = 2`, `frames` is\n`#[fun u₁ => ⌜u₁ = s₁⌝ ⊓ fun u₂ => ⌜u₂ = s₂⌝ ⊓ pre, fun u₂ => ⌜u₂ = s₂⌝ ⊓ pre, pre]`.\nIts first entry `frame` holds at `s₁ s₂` exactly where `pre` holds, and is `⊥` at every other pair\nof states, so `pre ⊑ X s₁ s₂` and `frame ⊑ X` are equivalent.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/ExcessArgsFrame.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo","kind":"structure","line":17,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrameInfo","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/VCGen/ExcessArgsFrame.lean#L17-L25"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.AppBuilder","Lean.Meta.Basic","Std.Internal.Order.Heyting"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.VCGen.ExcessArgsFrame"}